```Unusual upload volume per user per app using median/MAD (robust to the outlier itself). Floor of 500 KB removes noise.```
index=proxy sourcetype=proxy:csv earliest=-14d
| lookup app_inventory domain AS dest OUTPUT app
| eval app=coalesce(app, "UNMAPPED:".dest)
| stats sum(bytes_out) AS bytes_out BY app user
| eventstats median(bytes_out) AS med BY app
| eval absdev=abs(bytes_out-med)
| eventstats median(absdev) AS mad BY app
| eval robust_z=round(0.6745*(bytes_out-med)/if(mad=0,1,mad),1)
| where robust_z>3 AND bytes_out>500000
| sort - robust_z
